Oh! Yes, but it's not him. And I don't work there anymore.

29
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:54,260
他的名字叫托尼
His name is Tony.

30
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:55,800
我三个月前和他认识的
I met him three months ago.

31
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:56,960
他是有史以来最棒的男人
He's the greatest guy ever.

32
00:00:57,080 --> 00:00:58,840
