A girl could do a lot worse.

356
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:27,560
你知道吗 米奇尔
You know what, Mitchell?

357
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:29,680
抱歉我又要表现出我密苏里人的性格了
Forgive me if my Missouri is showing,

358
00:12:29,780 --> 00:12:31,240
但她这不是结婚
but what she is doing is not marriage.

359
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:33,077
而是对婚姻的讥笑 她是在"讥婚"
It's a mockery of marriage. It's mockerage.

360
00:12:33,077 --> 00:12:35,148
-我得阻止她 -别别 不行
- And I'm gonna stop it. - No, no, you're not.

361
00:12:35,148 --> 00:12:37,240
我认为你在这事上掺入了一些
I can't help but think you're infusing the situation

362
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:38,840
你自己的郁闷沮丧情绪
with just a touch of your own frustration.

363
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:41,120
为什么 因为我们共同生活了十年吗
Why, because we've built a life together for the last ten years?

364
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:42,480
因为我们一起抚养孩子吗
Because we're raising a child?

365
00:12:42,880 --> 00:12:44,580
还是因为我第一个想出在我们婚礼上
Or because I was the first person to think of doing

366
00:12:44,580 --> 00:12:46,180
表演一段精心编排的舞蹈
an elaborately choreographed dance at our wedding,

367
00:12:46,180 --> 00:12:47,260
而现在那点子都被人用烂了
and now it's been done to death?

368
00:12:47,560 --> 00:12:48,400
如果能让你好受点的话
Makes you feel any better,

369
00:12:48,400 --> 00:12:50,640
我想说我是死也不会同意跟你跳的
I was never gonna do that.

370
00:12:50,640 --> 00:12:51,980
但我理解你
But... I get it.

371
00:12:52,220 --> 00:12:53,660
你猜怎么着 只要伴郎
Well, you know what? She can't get married

372
00:12:53,660 --> 00:12:55,260
不把婚戒递给她 她就没法结婚
if the best man doesn't hand over the wedding ring.

373
00:12:55,260 --> 00:12:56,400
-你不会要这么做吧 -我会的
- You wouldn't. - Yes, I would.

374
00:12:56,400 --> 00:12:57,420
婚戒在哪里 给我
Where is it? Give it to me.

375
00:12:57,420 --> 00:12:58,580
-给我戒指 小卡 -别闹 别闹
- Give me the ring. Cam. - Stop. Stop.

376
00:12:58,580 --> 00:13:01,620
-你得交给我 -我总算知道你们的体位了
- You have to give me... - Oh, well, this is a mystery solved.

377
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:03,320
谢谢
Thank you!

378
00:13:04,680 --> 00:13:06,420
-好 我们开始吧 -好
- Okay. Let's go do this. - Okay.

379
00:13:06,849 --> 00:13:08,619
托尼的帅气指数有几分
How hot does Tony look?

380
00:13:08,619 --> 00:13:10,180
是跟酒保比还是...
On a scale of 1 to bartender, or...

381
00:13:10,180 --> 00:13:11,040
别多嘴 小卡
Reel it in, Cam.

382
00:13:12,400 --> 00:13:13,580
我觉得这东西坏掉了
I think this is broken.

383
00:13:13,580 --> 00:13:15,900
我们得找个别的车位
We're gonna have to find another spot.

384
00:13:15,900 --> 00:13:17,080
不行 看电影会迟到的
No, we'll be late for the movie.

385
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:18,100
你确定你的操作方法正确吗
Are you sure you're doing it right?

386
00:13:18,220 --> 00:13:19,900
你我都知道 我懂得如何刷信用卡
We both know I know how to use a credit card.

387
00:13:20,040 --> 00:13:21,040
好吧 我在收费器上留个条吧
All right, I'll put a note on the meter.

388
00:13:21,080 --> 00:13:21,840
等我找张纸
Let me get a piece of paper.

389
00:13:22,340 --> 00:13:23,660
也许这是个不祥的预兆
Maybe this is a bad sign.

390
00:13:23,840 --> 00:13:25,820
也许我不该来看电影
Maybe I'm not supposed to be in the movie theater.

391
00:13:25,820 --> 00:13:27,769
我应该在家照看孩子们
I'm supposed to be at home with my babies.

392
00:13:27,769 --> 00:13:30,360
亲爱的 你我都知道 达丽娅懂得如何照看乔
Honey, we know that Daliya knows how to take care of Joe.

393
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:33,060
那曼尼呢 难道要他自己放洗澡水吗
And what about manny? He's supposed to run his own bath?

394
00:13:33,300 --> 00:13:35,000
考虑到他最近的情况
You know, considering what's been going on with him,

395
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:36,640
也许你给他留点空间是好的
it might be good for you to give him a little space.

396
00:13:36,900 --> 00:13:37,960
这本来就是他的主意
I mean, this was his idea.

397
00:13:38,740 --> 00:13:39,500
什么是他的主意
What was?

398
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:40,900
让我们今晚出来约会
That we go out tonight,

399
00:13:40,900 --> 00:13:42,720
好让我们能有些独处的时间
so that we could get some alone time.

400
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:44,460
真贴心
Oh, that's sweet.

401
00:13:44,460 --> 00:13:46,125
-糟糕 -怎么了
- Uh-oh. - What?

402
00:13:46,125 --> 00:13:47,959
我们得回家去 看 曼尼的笔记本
We gotta get home. Look--Manny's notebook.

403
00:13:47,959 --> 00:13:49,900
又画画了还有首诗 《达丽娅颂》
More drawings and a poem-- "Ode to Daliya."

404
00:13:49,900 --> 00:13:52,360
所以那不是我的胸部 是达丽娅的胸部吗
So those were not my boobs? They were Daliya's boobs?

405
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:54,000
对 这画的不是《下台阶的裸女》
Yep. This is not a "Nude descending a staircase,"

406
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,560
而是《扫台阶的裸女》
this is a "Nude vacuuming a staircase."

407
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:59,700
好了 曼尼 乔睡着了
Okay, Manny. Joe's asleep.

408
00:13:59,780 --> 00:14:00,680
你晚餐想吃什么
What do you want for dinner?

409
00:14:01,020 --> 00:14:03,560
实际上 晚餐已经准备好了
Actually, already taken care of.

410
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:16,200
食物不是用来摆弄的哦
You shouldn't play with your food.

411
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:17,520
你怎么会在这里
What are you doing here?

412
00:14:17,620 --> 00:14:19,180
我知道你不高兴我离开
I knew you were upset I left,

413
00:14:19,180 --> 00:14:20,920
我感觉很内疚 就回来了
and I felt bad, so I came back,

414
00:14:21,160 --> 00:14:22,160
你因为内疚而回来的吗
You're here out of guilt?

415
00:14:22,380 --> 00:14:23,940
我知道 我长大了
I know. I'm growing up.

416
00:14:24,940 --> 00:14:27,020
你干吗对我翻白眼
Why are you rolling your eyes at me?

417
00:14:27,080 --> 00:14:28,140
我这样做多贴心啊
I'm doing a nice thing.

418
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:30,580
因为我希望你是因为你想回来才回来的
Because I want you to be here because you wantto be here.

419
00:14:30,620 --> 00:14:32,300
好吧 你现在真的好黏人
Okay, you're being really needy right now.

420
00:14:32,300 --> 00:14:34,220
天呐 你更年期到了吗
Oh, my god. Are you going through the change?

421
00:14:34,220 --> 00:14:37,060
不要每次我表现出点情绪就这么问
Stop asking me that every time I express an emotion.

422
00:14:37,780 --> 00:14:41,180
不 我没有 只是因为这里太热了
And no, I am not. It's just so damn hot in here.

423
00:14:41,429 --> 00:14:44,420
我很失望 仅此而已
I am disappointed, that's all.

424
00:14:44,420 --> 00:14:47,020
你小的时候 我们做什么都在一起
When you were little, we used to do everything together.

425
00:14:47,420 --> 00:14:50,240
而我以为那时的你又回归了
And I thought maybe you were coming back around,

426
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:52,020
我们又能成为闺蜜了
and we could be friends again.

427
00:14:52,020 --> 00:14:54,740
我只是怀念作为女儿生活的一部分的感觉了
I just... miss being part of my daughter's life.

428
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:56,560
大家好 感谢各位的到来
Hey, everybody. Thanks for coming.

429
00:15:09,280 --> 00:15:12,440
我还以为是要演奏古典音乐的呢
I thought this was supposed to be some sort of classical thing.

430
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:13,320
我也是
Me, too.

431
00:15:20,180 --> 00:15:21,220
她还会唱歌
She sings?

432
00:15:21,740 --> 00:15:24,000
我都认不出那个小妮子了
I don't even know who that is.

433
00:15:30,840 --> 00:15:34,080
天呐 菲尔 你好幽默
Oh, my god, Phil, you are hilarious.

434
00:15:34,520 --> 00:15:36,980
是的 那是我20年来深得老婆欢心的诀窍
Yep. That's how I got my wife of 20 years.

435
00:15:36,980 --> 00:15:39,387
麻烦结账 谢谢
Could we get the check, please?

436
00:15:39,400 --> 00:15:40,400
我来吧
Oh, I got this.

437
00:15:40,400 --> 00:15:43,140
幽默又大方
Ooh, funny and generous.

438
00:15:43,140 --> 00:15:44,740
要是我丈夫能像你一样
If my husband were more like you...

439
00:15:44,740 --> 00:15:45,900
也许我就不会离婚了
maybe I'd still be married.

440
00:15:46,240 --> 00:15:47,540
要是我老婆在这里
Well, if my wife were here,

441
00:15:47,540 --> 00:15:49,980
她会希望我清楚我要对她绝对忠诚
she'd want me to be clear that I'm fully committed to her.

442
00:15:50,400 --> 00:15:51,500
你知道的 对吧
You know that, right?

443
00:15:51,860 --> 00:15:52,260
什么
What?

444
00:15:52,260 --> 00:15:53,760
没有 我只是想确定一下
No, I just wanna make sure,

445
00:15:53,760 --> 00:15:54,940
因为你解开了一颗扣子
because you unbuttoned a button,

446
00:15:54,940 --> 00:15:56,440
而我...爱我的老婆 所以
and I... love my wife, so--

447
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:57,860
是你跟我打情骂俏
You were the one who was flirting

448
00:15:57,860 --> 00:15:59,800
-还说我们是在约会 -那是个玩笑
- and saying we're on a date. - That was a joke,

449
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:01,600
但要是我误导了你 我很抱歉
But I'm--I'm sorry if I misled you at all.

450
00:16:01,780 --> 00:16:02,620
谢谢
Thank you.

451
00:16:03,760 --> 00:16:04,800
但你还摸了人家呢
But there was a lot of touching.

452
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:06,280
我碰了一下你的肩膀而已
I touched your shoulder for a second.

453
00:16:06,400 --> 00:16:08,260
不 更像是轻抚 像这样
No, it was more of a stroke, like this--

454
00:16:09,520 --> 00:16:10,980
好吧 非常抱歉
Okay. I'm so sorry

455
00:16:10,980 --> 00:16:12,500
我用胸部碰了你的手
for touching your hand with my boob.

456
00:16:12,800 --> 00:16:13,840
我是说用你的手碰了我的胸部
I mean my boob with your hand.

457
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:14,860
你很喜欢玩这种把戏吗
Is this your little game?

458
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:17,340
你故意勾搭一个失落的离异女人
You cop a feel on a sad divorcee

459
00:16:17,340 --> 00:16:19,060
然后假装是我在调戏你
and then pretend I'm the one coming on to you?

460
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:20,700
-这样感觉如何 -好奇怪
- How does that feel? - Oh. Weird.

461
00:16:20,880 --> 00:16:22,540
你喜欢吗 是不是
You like it? Yeah?

462
00:16:23,360 --> 00:16:23,840
这样又如何
Little bit of that?

463
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:24,554
-爽吧 -什么 不要
- Yeah. - Little bit of whoa. No.

464
00:16:24,554 --> 00:16:27,280
你喜欢这样 是不是
You probably like this. Don't you?

465
00:16:27,280 --> 00:16:29,280
打住 你女儿就在那边呢
Oh, stop it. Your daughter's right over there.

466
00:16:29,740 --> 00:16:31,300
我的小货车就停在外边
My minivan is right outside.

467
00:16:31,400 --> 00:16:32,660
我不是那个意思
That is not what I meant.

468
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:35,880
比萨饼真好吃
This pizza is delicious.

469
00:16:36,260 --> 00:16:38,900
我也爱吃 我们的共同点真多
I like it, too. We have so much in common.

470
00:16:39,660 --> 00:16:40,860
你看过菜单的背面了吗
Have you seen the back of your menu?

471
00:16:44,840 --> 00:16:48,660
丝绸一般的长发 细腻的橄榄色皮肤
"With silken hair and supple olive skin

472
00:16:48,660 --> 00:16:51,720
还有那双会洗衣服的纤纤玉手
and hands that wash the laundry of my kin..."

473
00:16:52,700 --> 00:16:53,300
曼尼
Oh, Manny...

474
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:55,340
下面还有12行呢
You still have 12 lines to go.

475
00:16:55,620 --> 00:16:57,800
剧透一下 我爱你
Spoiler alert-- I love you.

476
00:16:58,300 --> 00:17:00,280
好了 离保姆远一点
Okay, back away from the nanny.

477
00:17:00,600 --> 00:17:04,660
我的天 完全就像麦当娜的MTV一样淫靡嘛
Oh, my god, it looks like a Madonna video in here!

478
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:06,640
-你们怎么没去看电影 -我们现在就得谈谈
- Why aren't you at the movies? - We need to talk right now.

479
00:17:06,640 --> 00:17:08,107
-你对我儿子做了什么 -我没有
- What have you done to my son?! - I didn't--

480
00:17:08,120 --> 00:17:08,940
她什么也没做
She didn't do anything.

481
00:17:09,200 --> 00:17:10,580
你们为什么非要让我丢人
Why do you have to embarrass me?

482
00:17:10,580 --> 00:17:13,041
让你丢人 如果你没有爱上...
Embarrass you? Maybe if you didn't fall in love...

483
00:17:13,712 --> 00:17:14,840
别吵了
Stop this!

484
00:17:14,840 --> 00:17:16,380
你们会吵醒宝宝的
You're going to wake the baby.

485
00:17:16,880 --> 00:17:18,720
我要和曼尼私下说两句
Now Manny and I are having a private discussion.

486
00:17:18,780 --> 00:17:20,300
请给我们一点时间
So please, give us a minute.

487
00:17:20,300 --> 00:17:23,175
-我现在就给你时间 -歌洛莉亚 歌洛莉亚
- I'll give you your minute right this minute. - Gloria. Gloria.

488
00:17:25,800 --> 00:17:26,960
说吧 曼尼
Go ahead, Manny.

489
00:17:27,600 --> 00:17:29,780
我不是说我们现在就要做什么
I'm not saying we need to do anything right away.

490
00:17:30,080 --> 00:17:31,960
我只是要求你等我几年
I'm just asking you to wait a few years.

491
00:17:32,380 --> 00:17:33,840
你真好
You are so sweet.

492
00:17:34,540 --> 00:17:36,040
无论谁最终和你在一起
Whoever ends up with you

493
00:17:36,040 --> 00:17:37,840
她都将是全世界最幸运的女生
is the luckiest woman in the world.

494
00:17:37,980 --> 00:17:39,000
那人可以是你啊
That could be you.

495
00:17:39,900 --> 00:17:40,420
不
No.

496
00:17:40,920 --> 00:17:43,520
我不够幸运 因为我出生太早了
I am unlucky, because I was born too soon.

497
00:17:43,800 --> 00:17:45,340
我不能让你这样虚度年华
And I can't have you wait around.

498
00:17:45,620 --> 00:17:46,620
诗人要成长
Poets have to live.

499
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:48,880
而且过几年 你对我的感觉就会不同了
Besides, in a few years, you'll feel differently.

500
00:17:49,120 --> 00:17:51,780
你错了 我这辈子对你的感觉都不会变
You're wrong. I'll feel this way for the rest of my life.

501
00:17:51,780 --> 00:17:52,667
曼尼 等等
Well, Manny, wait.

502
00:17:52,667 --> 00:17:53,889
-曼尼宝贝 -别来烦我
- Ay, Manny, papito lindo-- - Leave me alone.

503
00:17:54,700 --> 00:17:58,760
对不起
Sorry about that.

504
00:17:59,360 --> 00:18:01,820
不用 这是我收到的最甜蜜的礼物
Don't be. It's the sweetest offer I've ever gotten.

505
00:18:01,820 --> 00:18:04,620
真对不起 我刚才冲你大叫
I am so sorry that I screamed at you.

506
00:18:04,620 --> 00:18:06,760
你刚才对他说的话真贴心
It was so nice what you told him in there.

507
00:18:09,140 --> 00:18:11,240
我照顾曼尼 你照顾宝宝
I take Manny, you take the little one?

508
00:18:11,240 --> 00:18:11,884
好的
Okay.

509
00:18:11,884 --> 00:18:15,061
-你可能只需要 -她知道怎么做 杰
- You probably just-- - She knows what to do, Jay.

510
00:18:17,900 --> 00:18:18,300
提拉米苏
Tiramisu.

511
00:18:18,980 --> 00:18:20,600
我超爱吃他的提拉米苏
I love his tiramisu.

512
00:18:22,120 --> 00:18:23,720
婚姻是一种承诺
Marriage is a promise.

513
00:18:24,560 --> 00:18:26,500
是向全世界宣布你们对彼此的
It says to the world that you share a love

514
00:18:26,500 --> 00:18:27,880
爱与承诺
and a commitment to each other

515
00:18:27,880 --> 00:18:30,500
随着时间推移 那种爱只会越来越深
That will only grow deeper as the years go by.

516
00:18:31,020 --> 00:18:32,820
你们有写誓词吗
Now have you two written vows?

517
00:18:33,100 --> 00:18:33,900
是的 我先来
Yeah, I'll go.

518
00:18:34,440 --> 00:18:35,500
婚姻让我很害怕
Marriage terrifies me.

519
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:37,320
你看米奇和小卡
Take Mitch and Cam.

520
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:40,000
我以前总是觉得他们的人生闷死了
I used to think their life looked so boring.

521
00:18:40,340 --> 00:18:43,020
我永远做不来 付账单 洗盘子
I could never do it. Pay bills? Wash dishes?

522
00:18:43,460 --> 00:18:45,000
每天醒来都看到同一张脸
Wake up to the same face every day?

523
00:18:45,080 --> 00:18:46,680
我为他们感到悲哀
I felt sorry for them.

524
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:47,728
你想表达什么意思
Where is this headed?

525
00:18:47,740 --> 00:18:49,080
但他们不闷
But they're not bored.

526
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:51,570
原来 只要是和真命天子在一起
It turns out when you're with the right person,

527
00:18:52,280 --> 00:18:55,740
就可以穿着睡衣在晚上十点换壁架纸
you can change shelf paper at 10:00 at night in your pajamas

528
00:18:55,740 --> 00:18:58,180
哪里都不想去
and not wanna be anywhere else.

529
00:18:58,180 --> 00:19:00,340
他们对彼此的爱就有这么深
That's how much they love each other.

530
00:19:00,340 --> 00:19:03,020
-太对了 -刚才我看到你的脸
- We sure do. - And when I just saw your face,

531
00:19:03,020 --> 00:19:04,580
让我想起
I remembered...

532
00:19:05,540 --> 00:19:07,220
我也是这样的爱你
that's how much I love you.

533
00:19:07,640 --> 00:19:08,640
多谢你出现在我生命里
Thanks for being here.

534
00:19:08,640 --> 00:19:11,220
我们哪里也不会去 萨尔
We wouldn't be anywhere else, Sal.

535
00:19:11,220 --> 00:19:12,940
你有准备誓词吗
And do you have anything prepared?

536
00:19:13,660 --> 00:19:14,380
说吧 宝贝
Hit me, baby.

537
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:17,600
昨晚我和脱衣舞娘舌吻了
I made out with a stripper last night.

538
00:19:17,600 --> 00:19:19,962
抱歉 我只是想在婚前坦白
Sorry. I just wanna start this clean.

539
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:23,460
我和酒保舌吻了 就在一小时前
I made out with a bartender... an hour ago.

540
00:19:23,560 --> 00:19:25,440
你这样说 不是为了想安慰我吧
You're not just saying that to make me feel better, are you?

541
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:26,440
帮我作证 我有没有
Back me up. Didn't I?

542
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:28,200
-她绝对舌吻了 -我吻了
- She totally did. - I totally did!

543
00:19:28,200 --> 00:19:29,860
-他长得好帅 -那人非常帅气
- Yeah. He was hot, too. - He was very good-looking.

544
00:19:29,860 --> 00:19:32,420
-太好了 -真特别的誓词
- Nice. - Well. That was different.

545
00:19:32,420 --> 00:19:33,757
-戒指在谁手上 -我这儿
- Who's got the ring? - I do.

546
00:19:33,757 --> 00:19:35,132
给我
Hand 'em over.

547
00:19:39,240 --> 00:19:41,000
非常感谢
Thank you guys so much.

548
00:19:41,400 --> 00:19:42,900
艾丽克斯 宝贝 太棒了
Alex, honey, amazing.

549
00:19:43,100 --> 00:19:44,540
你为什么没有告诉我们
Why didn't you tell us?

550
00:19:44,549 --> 00:19:46,560
-我不知道 -刚刚真是太棒了
- Oh, I-I don't know. - That was so good.

551
00:19:46,560 --> 00:19:47,620
如果我不认识你
If I didn't know you,

552
00:19:47,620 --> 00:19:49,260
我肯定会说 那妹子酷毙了
I'd be all like, "That chick is cool."

553
00:19:50,500 --> 00:19:53,040
各位好 我是艾丽克斯的妈妈
Hey, guys, hi. I'm Alex's mom.

554
00:19:53,140 --> 00:19:54,940
你们太优秀了
You were terrific.

555
00:19:55,140 --> 00:19:56,540
你们好 我是她姐姐
Hey, and I'm her sister.

556
00:19:56,694 --> 00:19:58,209
我们要去吃晚餐
We're gonna go get some dinner.

557
00:19:58,209 --> 00:19:59,780
你要一起来吗
Do you wanna come with us?

558
00:19:59,780 --> 00:20:01,100
你可以带乐队的朋友一起来
You can bring your friends from the band.

559
00:20:01,100 --> 00:20:02,860
不用了 多谢 我们要出去
Um, no, thanks. We're actually going out,

560
00:20:02,860 --> 00:20:05,020
会有人送我回家的 回头见
and I have a ride home, so see you guys later.

561
00:20:05,020 --> 00:20:06,505
好的
Okay.

562
00:20:06,580 --> 00:20:08,300
我的天 真是不好意思
Oh, my god. Sorry about that.

563
00:20:08,900 --> 00:20:10,780
她刚刚是为我们两个道歉吗
Did she just apologize for us?

564
00:20:11,220 --> 00:20:13,040
-正是 -但我们只是想示好
- Yep. - But we were just being nice.

565
00:20:13,820 --> 00:20:14,700
感觉差劲吧
Sucks, doesn't it?

566
00:20:17,600 --> 00:20:20,520
卢克 抱歉萨梦的妈妈那么早就把她拉走了
Luke, I'm sorry Simone's mom dragged her away so fast.

567
00:20:20,840 --> 00:20:22,860
没事 反正我也快没话说了
It's okay. I was running out of things to say.

568
00:20:23,300 --> 00:20:24,680
看来我把你的好事搞砸了
Guess I kind of blew it for you, didn't I?

569
00:20:24,780 --> 00:20:28,240
没有 现在她妈禁止她和我出去
No. Now that her mom doesn't want her going out with me anymore,

570
00:20:28,460 --> 00:20:29,700
萨梦更想和我在一起了
Simone wants me more than ever.

571
00:20:30,140 --> 00:20:31,980
我想她快到反叛时期了
I guess she's heading into a rebellious stage.

572
00:20:31,980 --> 00:20:33,808
追求女孩的最佳时期
Best time to get 'em.

573
00:20:33,820 --> 00:20:35,980
永远不要害怕追求自己配不上的女孩
Never be afraid to go after a girl who's out of your league.

574
00:20:36,240 --> 00:20:37,800
我就是例子 这样才追到你妈
I did. That's how I got your mom.

575
00:20:38,100 --> 00:20:40,080
是啊 我总是好奇你怎么会追到老妈的
Yeah, I always wondered how you pulled that one off.

576
00:20:40,080 --> 00:20:43,043
她当时也处在反叛时期
She was in a rebellious stage, too.

577
00:20:43,440 --> 00:20:46,340
没错 你外公当年可不像现在这样喜欢我啊
Yep, grandpa wasn't always as crazy about me as he is now.

578
00:20:52,780 --> 00:20:54,680
我去开香槟 拿酒杯
I'm gonna go pop the champagne and get some glasses.

579
00:20:55,380 --> 00:20:55,880
我来帮忙
I'll help.

580
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:57,981
我去拿益智桌游
I'm gonna get Cranium.

581
00:21:04,740 --> 00:21:05,720
抱歉你不能参加婚礼
Sorry you couldn't come to the wedding.

582
00:21:05,800 --> 00:21:06,540
只限成人参加
It was no kids.

583
00:21:06,540 --> 00:21:09,783
没关系 我参加你下一场婚礼就好了
It's okay. I'll go to your next one.

584
00:21:12,136 --> 00:21:13,487
她的意思是
She--she just means when

585
00:21:13,487 --> 00:21:15,400
等她长大以后
she's not a kid anymore, you know?

586
00:21:15,400 --> 00:21:16,840
她知道我的意思
She knows what I mean.

587
00:21:18,040 --> 00:21:19,200
我不喜欢你
I don't like you.

588
00:21:19,360 --> 00:21:20,700
我才不在乎呢
I'll get over it.
